# Large bundled dependency (PyTorch C++ libs, OpenCV+ffmpeg runtime closure)
# — never commit; fetched by fetch-thirdparty.sh instead. The opencv closure
# is also covered by the **/*.dylib rule below, but pin it explicitly too so
# a future non-dylib addition under it (docs, headers) doesn't slip through.
**/thirdparty/libtorch/
**/thirdparty/opencv/
# Scilab toolbox build artifacts
**/*.bin
**/*.dylib
**/*.so
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/loader.sce
**/unloader.sce
**/cleaner.sce
**/cleaner_gateway.sce
**/loader_gateway.sce
**/macros/lib
**/macros/names
**/jar/
.DS_Store
